@api = http://localhost:5000
@closedAssignmentId = 2

### 1. Danh sach bai tap (mong doi 200)
GET {{api}}/api/assignments

### 2. Chi tiet bai tap 1 (mong doi 200)
GET {{api}}/api/assignments/1

### 3. Bai tap khong ton tai (mong doi 404 ASSIGNMENT_NOT_FOUND)
GET {{api}}/api/assignments/999

### 4. Tao bai nop (mong doi 201 Created va header Location)
# Chay request nay truoc cac request can ID phia duoi.
# @name createSubmission
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/rest-api"
}

### 5. Doc lai bai nop vua tao (mong doi 200)
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### 6. Body rong (mong doi 400 INVALID_SUBMISSION)
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "",
  "repositoryUrl": ""
}

### 7. Nop vao bai tap khong ton tai (mong doi 404 ASSIGNMENT_NOT_FOUND)
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/999/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV999",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv999"
}

### 8. Thieu Content-Type (mong doi 415)
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions

{
  "studentCode": "SV002",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv002"
}

### 9. JSON hong (mong doi 400 tu framework)
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{"studentCode": "SV003",

### 10. PUT khong duoc ho tro (mong doi 405)
PUT {{api}}/api/assignments/1
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 11. Bai tap da dong (mong doi 400 ASSIGNMENT_CLOSED)
# Truoc tien tam sua IsOpen cua bai tap 2 thanh false trong List<AssignmentDto> o Program.cs,
# khoi dong lai API, sau do gui request nay. Sua lai true va khoi dong lai API sau khi thu.
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/{{closedAssignmentId}}/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV010",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv010"
}

### 12. Nop trung bai tap (mong doi 409 DUPLICATE_SUBMISSION)
# Gui lai sau request 4; StudentCode duoc so sanh khong phan biet hoa thuong.
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "sv001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/duplicate"
}

### 13. Xoa bai nop vua tao (mong doi 204 No Content)
DELETE {{api}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### 14. Doc bai nop da xoa (mong doi 404 SUBMISSION_NOT_FOUND)
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}
